Pages = {175-181},
Month = {JUN 1},
Abstract = {With the development of the social economy, the scale of cities has
   expanded rapidly, and the urban ecological imbalance has become
   increasingly severe, which has caused many urban problems. People
   gradually realise that cities and human beings develop more harmoniously
   and healthily by building and developing cities on the basis of natural
   ecology and seeking the harmonious coexistence of ecology and humanity.
   The results of the sustainable landscape ecological evaluation of Anhui
   Shilonghu National Wetland Park show that the park has good ecological,
   social, and economic benefits and functions. The urban ecological
   environment and social and economic development have a good supporting
   effect on the park, and its overall evaluation grade is good. Compared
   with other waterscape parks, the ecological function of urban wetland
   parks is the most basic and essential function of the landscape. It has
   multiple functions, such as popular science education and being close to
   nature and entertainment. Developing wetland ecological experience
   tourism activities benefits wetland protection and ecologically
   coordinated, sustainable development. It can also comprehensively
   improve wetland parks' ecological, social, and economic benefits.},
