   van Kempen, Elise; Devilee, Jeroen; Swart, Wim; van Kamp, Irene, Natl Inst Publ Hlth \& Environm RIVM, Ctr Sustainabil Environm \& Hlth DMG, NL-3720 BA Bilthoven, Netherlands.},
DOI = {10.4103/1463-1741.144416},
